{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_410e37314419bdbb-428\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>《中年好聲音3》冠軍黃博近日推出今年第二首單曲《花說》。日前，黃博聯同顏米羔等一班《中聲》好友現身新歌巡禮，吸引大批粉絲到場支持。今次更是黃博首次於商場公開演繹新歌，憑藉其磁性嗓音成功俘虜全場。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_410e37314419bdbb-429\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>今次新歌的 MV 特別邀請到憑劇集《正義女神》飾演少年犯「高成彬」一角而人氣急升的劉倬昕演出，對於對方的大力相助，黃博表示十分感謝：「非常榮幸，呢個係佢嘅第一個MV，喺入面嘅表演真係非常精彩。」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_410e37314419bdbb-429\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"572e25b4-873c-457a-b6d2-268720a4350a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026G2zf5bb2zX1789548561.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"572e25b4-873c-457a-b6d2-268720a4350a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_410e37314419bdbb-430\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>談及新歌的歌詞創作，黃博在接受 TVB 娛樂新聞台訪問時透露，歌曲是以花朵為主題，寄意人生的不同階段與經歷：「特登喺歌詞入面加入咗好多種唔同嘅花，其實係想講每一個人嘅唔同嘅經歷，從一開始天不怕地不怕，到有啲挫折，慢慢搵返自己，慢慢等待花開，再到新嘅春天，新嘅開始咁樣。」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_410e37314419bdbb-430\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b3a884e0-a019-4e0e-8f3a-6115901d98c5.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/202632mmAPBVqS1789548560.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b3a884e0-a019-4e0e-8f3a-6115901d98c5.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">TVB 娛樂新聞台</span>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T09:20:10.917333+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}